1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,852
We have five blue circles in a group.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,828
We can scale the entire group larger.

3
00:00:05,933 --> 00:00:09,337
Rotate all circles around their common center.

4
00:00:09,466 --> 00:00:12,558
And change the color of the whole group to red.

5
00:00:12,666 --> 00:00:16,862
Group operations apply to all members simultaneously.

6
00:00:16,933 --> 00:00:18,393
Removing the group.

